<br>
RORO KE YE DI ZAINAB NE SADA JAATI HAI BEHAN UTHO BHAIYA,<br>
AAB KARKE TERA CHEHLUM DUKHIYA JAATI HAI BEHAN UTHO BHAIYA<br>
<br>
KYA KEHKE MANAU LAILA KO DOO KAISE DILASA KUBRA KO,<br>
TUM AAKE INHE SAMJHAOZARA JAATI HAI BEHAN UTHO BHAIYA<br>
<br>
PARDE KA NIGEHBAA KOI NAHI AAB HAAL KA PURSA KOI NAHI,<br>
 SAB CHOD GAYE MUJHKOTANHA JAATI HAI BEHAN UTHO BHAIYA<br>
<br>
SAR NANGE PHIRI BAAZARO MEIN JAANA HI PADA DARBARO MEIN,<br>
 HAR TARAH KE SEH KER ZULM-O-JAFA JAATI HAI BEHAN UTHO BHAIYA<br>
<br>
EK THAIS JIGAR PER LAGTI THI JAB RO KE SAKINA KEHTI THI,<br>
 KIS JA HAI PHUPI BABA MERA JAATI HAI BEHAN UTHO BHAIYA<br>
<br>
KURTA BHI JALA GOUHAR BHI CHINNE BACHI NE TAMACHE BHI KHAYE,<br>
 THA SARA BADAN ZAKHMI USKA JAATI HAI BEHAN UTHO BHAIYA..